107-/** Poll until `done` holds (true) or `error` is visible (false); throw when neither happens.
108- *  Each check returns as soon as it can. An error already visible at the first look after the
109- *  click may be left over from the action before (the screen clears it when a new action is
110- *  submitted, see README): it counts as this action's refusal once it has gone away and been
111- *  shown again, once its text changes, or once ERROR_GRACE has passed with no result.
112- *  `already` says `done` held BEFORE the action (watching a person already watched, saving a
113- *  setting at its current value): then the result on screen proves nothing, and the action
114- *  counts as taken only once ERROR_GRACE has passed with no refusal shown. */

